  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SCAAN (Security Communications and Analysis Network)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Security Communications and Analysis Network (SCAAN) will enhance the safety and security of International, Impartial and Independent Mechanism to Assist in the Investigation and Prosecution of Persons Responsible for the Most Serious Crimes Under International Law Committed in the Syrian Arab Republic Since March 2011 (IIIM) personnel. IIIM will equip their personnel with SCAAN, connecting the staff members with a lifeline and real-time security updates to assist them in urgent situations.</narrative>
  </description>
